@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Mixed MVP / future. Retained broader-product associations require explicit future node labels; MVP uses only core/basic ProjectForge.
title MVP + EXPLICIT FUTURE PATHS — Big-picture event-storming board — proposed synthesis, no workshop performed
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

left to right direction
rectangle "Presentation / sharing lane" {
 rectangle "Owner: apply selected changes" as P1 #DAE8FC
 rectangle "Draft changes saved" as P2 #FFD59A
 rectangle "Owner: separately confirm publication" as P3 #DAE8FC
 rectangle "Publication revision recorded" as P4 #FFD59A
 P1 --> P2
 P2 ..> P3 : separate human decision
 P3 --> P4
}
rectangle "Actual-material lane" {
 rectangle "Owner: record actual event + materials" as A1 #DAE8FC
 rectangle "Submission capture recorded" as A2 #FFD59A
 rectangle "Completeness depends on actual usable references" as A3 #E1D5E7
 A1 --> A2
 A2 --> A3
}
rectangle "Git / execution lane" {
 rectangle "Authorized actor: merge exact revisions" as G1 #DAE8FC
 rectangle "Native ref change observed" as G2 #FFD59A
 rectangle "Evaluate supported trigger + real enabling gates" as G3 #E1D5E7
 rectangle "Admit attributable attempt OR block" as G4 #DAE8FC
 G1 --> G2
 G2 --> G3
 G3 --> G4
}
rectangle "Work lane" {
 rectangle "[AFTER MVP] Authorized actor: close Sprint period" as W1 #DAE8FC
 rectangle "Period outcome recorded" as W2 #FFD59A
 rectangle "Goal outcome / item acceptance remain independent" as W3 #E1D5E7
 W1 --> W2
 W2 --> W3
}
legend bottom
 Blue = command / actor intent; orange = candidate past-tense domain fact; purple = policy / constraint.
 Hotspots: reference/deletion guards; actual-material provenance; execution feasibility; detailed source policy.
 No event bus, event sourcing, automatic deployment or new accepted event schema is selected.
endlegend
@enduml
